{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"S03把先前尝过的安稳写成安稳变得重要，继而产生依恋，并对亲近能否继续变得敏感，构成了满足促成延续愿望的因果链。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"S03明确写出持续追问没有带来更多确定，反而使注意力重新陷入自我、紧张最终僵住，对应了试图抓牢当下只增加自身牵动，却不能保证亲近延续的机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"S04明确指出确认的需要暂时退下并不是问题得到了解释，而是当下的亲近暂时消除了疑问的紧迫性，写出了身体松弛不等于心理问题解决的因果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"why\": \"S14写到亲近结束后仍有温柔的回望，同时带着失去感，但没有解释独自回味为何仍能带来快乐，也没有写明这种回味为何不能消除继续亲近的愿望。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [\n    \"S01：把人物设定成没有任何前面的经历可依靠，替他断言了一种听感无法证实的过往经验状况，尽管没有编出具体往事。\",\n    \"S06（并延续至S07、S09、S12、S14）：把抽象的亲近明确设定为指向另一个人的关系，并进一步赋予人物对对方本身的在意；音乐本身无法证实这个关系对象的存在。\"\n  ],\n  \"loops\": [\n    \"S03：先用持续追问和确认来寻求确定，得不到答案后转为僵住；这里把追问失败后的冻结写成应对状态的切换，但冻结本身并不是一个新的主动策略。\",\n    \"S05：面对陌生变化，先急于判断它意味着什么，短暂无措后又改为不再判断、把注意力移开并顺着经验继续走，形成了从解释控制到放任体验的策略切换。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9dcb4c6e-a215-4443-bedb-f168a7ee086f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130744129096Z", "elapsed_seconds": 474.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:15:38.186186+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9b7e41530ce1a2650695b304e3f82ff4571cb457c1d0848263f09dca32c8937a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130744129096Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3a3b2fbb6a532209d615aaba6bc076280e8ec599236ac35774331f35cebceb42"}}}
